{"id":"n89630-1-7","stage":4,"title":"흩날리다 · 飞散","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89630-1-7-1","ko":"지수 못 봤어?","zh":"你看见智秀了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/979a8e11e114cce6b8a3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89630-1-7-2","ko":"아까 보니 머리카락을 흩날리면서 바쁘게 뛰어가던데.","zh":"刚才看见她急忙跑过去，头发都飘起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"看样子，看来","explanation":"보다：看样子，看来；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"머리카락을","meaning":"发丝","explanation":"머리카락：发丝；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"머리카락","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55381","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리카락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흩날리면서","meaning":"飞散，飞舞，飘散","explanation":"흩날리다：飞散，飞舞，飘散；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"흩날리다","audio":"/audio/6ec41becaff1ab4dd781.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89630","senseId":"1","lemma":"흩날리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바쁘게","meaning":"匆忙，急忙","explanation":"바쁘다：匆忙，急忙；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"2","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어가던데.","meaning":"跑去，跑到，奔去","explanation":"뛰어가다：跑去，跑到，奔去；던데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어가다","audio":"/audio/4a166b1354edef73bafd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14439","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看样子，看来","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"由前面的话语所指的行动或状态来推算或表示即使不正确但知道。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"7cffa7bdc9cb4857","term":"머리카락","zh":"发丝","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3","entryId":"55381","definition":"一根根头发。","pronunciation":["머리카락"]},{"id":"6ec41becaff1ab4d","term":"흩날리다","zh":"飞散，飞舞，飘散","audio":"/audio/6ec41becaff1ab4dd781.mp3","entryId":"89630","definition":"散开飞起来；或使之如此。","pronunciation":["흔날리다"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"匆忙，急忙","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"非常急。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"4a166b1354edef73","term":"뛰어가다","zh":"跑去，跑到，奔去","audio":"/audio/4a166b1354edef73bafd.mp3","entryId":"14439","definition":"向着某个地方快速跑过去。","pronunciation":["뛰어가다","뛰여가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/79fc023da0c886e23850.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.05,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89630","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.8767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你看见智秀了吗？","刚才看见她急忙跑过去，头发都飘起来了。","智秀只要被朋友们稍微逗一下就会哭，真让人担心。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你看见智秀了吗？","刚才看见她急忙跑过去，头发都飘起来了。","智秀只要被朋友们稍微逗一下就会哭，真让人担心。"],"answer":1}]}
